<title>USA: InControl System wins European product ok.</title>
<headline>InControl System wins European product ok.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>InControl Inc on Friday said its Metrix implantable atrial defibrillator and related components have been approved for sale in countries of the European Union.</p>
<p>&quot;The METRIX System represents the world's first approved implantable device to treat atrial fibrillation,&quot; Kurt Wheeler, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
